<!DOCTYPE html><!-- Last Published: Wed Sep 30 2026 23:54:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time) --><html data-wf-domain="www.shimmer.care" data-wf-page="61646bd58e9dca244f1cb9b1" data-wf-site="5fd53aee74de0344a4307aad" data-wf-collection="61646bd58e9dca98ee1cb914" data-wf-item-slug="can-naming-your-feelings-help-adhd"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><link href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin="anonymous"/><title>Can naming your feelings help ADHD? - Shimmer ADHD Coaching</title><meta content="Discover how the Feelings Wheel works and how naming your emotions can help manage ADHD symptoms." name="description"/><meta content="Can naming your feelings help ADHD? - Shimmer ADHD Coaching" property="og:title"/><meta content="Discover how the Feelings Wheel works and how naming your emotions can help manage ADHD symptoms." property="og:description"/><meta content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ffbd248b8c48c3bbdf4e481/66e8aa5b0300b986758639c4_images.jpg" property="og:image"/><meta content="Can naming your feelings help ADHD? - Shimmer ADHD Coaching" name="twitter:title"/><meta content="Discover how the Feelings Wheel works and how naming your emotions can help manage ADHD symptoms." name="twitter:description"/><meta content="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ffbd248b8c48c3bbdf4e481/66e8aa5b0300b986758639c4_images.jpg" name="twitter:image"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta content="summary_large_image" name="twitter:card"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><link href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5fd53aee74de0344a4307aad/css/shimmer-e6c21c.webflow.shared.e2214e033.min.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" integrity="sha384-4iFOAzCYdVbfX76qPGGVkVw0Im5jxy6IE9KM/zBbKj3n7IvMdwrz/h3TrvUumUN/" crossorigin="anonymous"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect" crossorigin="anonymous"/><script src="https://ajax.g