6_shannon.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 49vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5fd53aee74de0344a4307aad/6501165ea9a4e2bd026edc96_shannon-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5fd53aee74de0344a4307aad/6501165ea9a4e2bd026edc96_shannon.webp 718w" alt="" class="social-proof-small-img-inner"/></div></div><div id="w-node-ead53436-38a0-c0c6-f7e2-198e13333cc4-13333cc4" class="social-proof-small-text">Over 100,000+ sessions and thousands of transformed lives with Shimmer.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="intake-questions-cta"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-qintake"><div class="w-embed"><style>
