</style></div><h2 class="heading-51"><strong>What do you want most right now?</strong></h2><div class="w-layout-grid intakeq_sm-component"><a href="https://app.shimmer.care/intake?embmanagingq=peace" class="intakeq_btn w-inline-block"><div id="w-node-a4eabe5f-d638-75df-d948-76161f654fe8-d0f9278b" class="intakeq_btn-icon"><div class="icon-embed-q text-color-teal w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ph" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M250.5 121.3a15.9 15.9 0 0 0-9.9-7.5a77.1 77.1 0 0 0-27.9-1.8a86.7 86.7 0 0 0-2.6-40.9a15.9 15.9 0 0 0-18.5-10.7a82.3 82.3 0 0 0-26.2 10.8a94.4 94.4 0 0 0-27.8-34.4a15.9 15.9 0 0 0-19.2 0a94.4 94.4 0 0 0-27.8 34.4a82.3 82.3 0 0 0-26.2-10.8a15.9 15.9 0 0 0-18.5 10.7a86.7 86.7 0 0 0-2.6 40.9a77.1 77.1 0 0 0-27.9 1.8A15.9 15.9 0 0 0 4 133.6c3.5 12.6 14.3 36.7 47.1 55.6s61.4 18.8 76.8 18.8h.2c15.4 0 44.2 0 76.8-18.8s43.6-43 47.1-55.6a16 16 0 0 0-1.5-12.3Zm-55.6-45.2c2.8 8.4 5.4 23.5-.3 42.9l-.3 1.1a100.6 100.6 0 0 1-9.5 21.5a120.3 120.3 0 0 1-17.4 23.1c5.1-12 8.6-26.7 8.6-44.7a116.4 116.4 0 0 0-4.7-33.6a66.6 66.6 0 0 1 23.6-10.3ZM128 49.6c9.6 7.2 32 28.4 32 70.4s-22.7 63.6-32 70.4c-9.3-6.8-32-27.9-32-70.4s22.4-63.2 32-70.4ZM61.1 76.1a66.6 66.6 0 0 1 23.6 10.3A116.4 116.4 0 0 0 80 120c0 18 3.5 32.7 8.6 44.7a120.3 120.3 0 0 1-17.4-23.1a99.1 99.1 0 0 1-9.5-21.6l-.3-.9c-5.8-19.5-3.1-34.6-.3-43Zm-41.8 53.2c6.2-1.6 15.9-2.8 28.4-.6a117.1 117.1 0 0 0 9.7 20.9a137.9 137.9 0 0 0 33.2 38.6a123.4 123.4 0 0 1-31.5-12.9c-27.8-16.1-36.8-35.8-39.8-46Zm177.6 46a123.4 123.4 0 0 1-31.5 12.9a137.9 137.9 0 0 0 33.2-38.6a117.1 117.1 0 0 0 9.7-20.9a68.8 68.8 0 0 1 28.3.5c-2.9 10.3-11.9 30-39.7 46.1Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="intakeq_btn-content"><div class="intakeq_card-content-top"><div class="intakeq-btn-heading">Peace &amp; calm</div></div></div><div id="w-node-a4eabe5f-d638-75df-d948-76161f654fee-d0f9278b" class="intakeq_right-arrow"><div class="icon-embed-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ph" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M96 220a12.2 12.2 0 0 1-8.5-3.5a12 12 0 0 1 0-17L159 128L87.5 56.5a12 12 0 0 1 17-17l80 80a12 12 0 0 1 0 17l-80 80A12.2 12.2 0 0 1 96 220Z"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="https://app.shimmer.care/intake?embmanagingq=progress" class="intakeq_btn w-inline-block"><div id="w-node-a4eabe5f-d638-75df-d948-76161f654ff1-d0f9278b" class="intakeq_btn-icon"><div class="icon-embed-q text-color-purple w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ph" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M164 80a28 28 0 1 0-28-28a28.1 28.1 0 0 0 28 28Zm0-40a12 12 0 1 1-12 12a12 12 0 0 1 12-12Zm90.9 155.9l-57.1-96.4a16.1 16.1 0 0 0-27.6 0l-26.1 44.1l-42.3-71.9a16 16 0 0 0-27.6 0L1.1 195.9a7.9 7.9 0 0 0 0 8.1a7.8 7.8 0 0 0 6.9 4h240a8.1 8.1 0 0 0 7-4a8.3 8.3 0 0 0-.1-8.1ZM88 79.8l23.7 40.2H64.3ZM22 192l32.9-56h66.2l16.1 27.4L154 192Zm150.6 0l-19.2-32.6l30.6-51.7l50 84.3Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="intakeq_btn-content"><div class="intakeq_card-content-top"><div class="intakeq-btn-heading">Progress on big goals</div></div></div><div id="w-node-a4eabe5f-d638-75df-d948-76161f654ff7-d0f9278b" class="intakeq_right-arrow"><div class="icon-embed-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify iconify--ph" width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="currentColor" d="M96 220a12.2 12.2 0 0 1-8.5-3.5a12 12 0 0 1